@page
@model ApiCombatGame.Pages.PrivacyModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-8" style="color: var(--md-sys-color-on-surface);">Privacy Policy</h1>

    <div class="max-w-none space-y-6" style="color: var(--md-sys-color-on-surface-variant);">
        <p class="text-sm" style="color: var(--md-sys-color-outline);">Last updated: @DateTime.UtcNow.ToString("MMMM dd, yyyy")</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-8" style="color: var(--md-sys-color-on-surface);">1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>When you create an account, we collect your username, email address, and an encrypted hash of your password. We also collect game-related data such as battle results, team configurations, and API usage statistics.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-8" style="color: var(--md-sys-color-on-surface);">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>We use your information to operate the game, process payments, improve our services, and communicate with you about your account.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-8" style="color: var(--md-sys-color-on-surface);">3. Payment Processing</h2>
        <p>Payment processing is handled by Stripe. We do not store your credit card information on our servers. Please review <a href="https://stripe.com/privacy" style="color: var(--md-sys-color-primary);" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Stripe's Privacy Policy</a> for details on how they handle your payment data.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-8" style="color: var(--md-sys-color-on-surface);">4. Data Security</h2>
        <p>We use industry-standard security measures to protect your data, including encrypted passwords, HTTPS connections, and secure API key management.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-8" style="color: var(--md-sys-color-on-surface);">5. Data Retention</h2>
        <p>We retain your account data for as long as your account is active. Battle logs and game data may be retained for analytics purposes. You may request deletion of your account and associated data.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-8" style="color: var(--md-sys-color-on-surface);">6. Contact</h2>
        <p>If you have questions about this privacy policy, please contact us through the game's support channels.</p>
    </div>
</div>
